WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=MPEGTS:900000,LOCAL:00:00:00.000

STYLE
::cue(.italic) { font-style:italic }

344
00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.321 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
肩膀向后下方收好，

345
00:17:01.822 --> 00:17:04.324 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
伙伴们，整个动作都保持脊柱延展。

346
00:17:04.625 --> 00:17:07.794 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
二、一，我们开始。

347
00:17:08.028 --> 00:17:10.030 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
右膝朝地面方向下降。

348
00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:13.733 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
控制着起身，再向下。

349
00:17:14.601 --> 00:17:20.073 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
再起身。这是原地弓步蹲，来，向上。

350
00:17:20.674 --> 00:17:23.109 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
没错，向下。

351
00:17:24.243 --> 00:17:26.246 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
向上。还剩两次。［欢呼］

352
00:17:26.445 --> 00:17:27.647 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
双膝弯曲。

353
00:17:28.382 --> 00:17:29.583 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
起身。最后一次。

354
00:17:29.816 --> 00:17:34.054 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
［欢呼］三、二、一，有力地起身。

355
00:17:34.154 --> 00:17:37.391 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
放下一只哑铃。［欢呼］

356
00:17:37.858 --> 00:17:39.927 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
回到转体推举。

357
00:17:40.627 --> 00:17:44.898 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
找到适合自己的动作位置，转体时注意，

358
00:17:45.265 --> 00:17:48.468 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
让转体方向另一侧的脚随动作转动。

359
00:17:48.769 --> 00:17:51.605 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
哑铃举到胸前，身体向左转。

360
00:17:51.805 --> 00:17:53.240 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
开始，推举。

361
00:17:53.774 --> 00:17:57.477 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
放下，复位。向右转，左脚随之转动。

362
00:17:57.945 --> 00:17:59.913 align:middle line:85%,start position:50%,middle
再放下，继续。

